This game is simply AMAZING, I highly recommend buying and playing this game!

If you love a deep and interesting story, compelling characters, amazing voice acting and interesting gameplay gimmicks, then this game is for you.

Main Points of the Game:

- Choice Based (Different dialogue choices and actions lead to different outcomes and results);

- RNG based mechanics (if you don't like RNG, maybe then reconsider buying the game, OR, look up game guides and tutorials first);

- Stats based skills (you can choose from a variety of character builds, that affect the rest of your entire game session);

- Amazing Story, World Building, Lore and Voice Acting;

- Deep Philosophy and Political Commentary;

If you want to play the game but hate the RNG, you can just reload saves to improve RNG results, it's okay, play the game how you want to play.

I won't spoil the story, but it's really well written and beautiful, and it has different endings depending on your choices.

9.5 / 10 - "Superstar Cop"

